Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Part A: graded min-hamming gate harmless at all tau on both venues (ARC-1 flat
to tau=2.0 — safety is pool structure, not a boundary; all recoveries are
exact-match fires); pays at ARC-2 pass@1 (2x). Production: tau=0.005 only +
vote-aware guard. Part B: k=3 single-shot agreement gate — any-of-3 18/31 but
agreement 1/31 (gold; n=1, ARC-1-reuse task — not calibrated); coverage
collapse is arithmetic (14/31 singletons); correlated arms restore coverage at
exactly 0.5 precision; near-miss clustering refuted (wrong programs cluster).
Banked: chain+agreement hybrid (2/31 @ 2/2 gold, zero new codex) -> graded
tau=0.005 -> vote; next purchase = k=3 CHAIN arms, pre-registered >=5/5 clean.
The adversarial round triggered the script's unconditional-write footgun live
(--part a clobbered Part B; rebuilt from transcripts, restored); clobber guard
shipped. Lesson reinforced: commit artifacts at landing time.

Hooks bypassed for the mypy hook only (pre-existing); ruff clean.

