+## 2026-06-10 (GAP-4 precision fixes: graded gate + agreement ensemble — 5/5 confirmed with narrowings; live clobber bug caught + fixed — outer-loop, Claude Fable 5)
+
+- [outer-loop] Operator: "Go with the arc_v2 probe" (continuation). Built `scripts/experiments/arc3_gap4_arc2_consistency_ensemble.py` running both panel-ranked precision fixes on the arc_v2 substrate.
+- **Part A (graded min-hamming gate, zero codex):** promote argmin-hamming candidate iff demo-perfect AND min-hamming ≤ τ, else vote. ARC-1 validation MANDATE passed — zero pass@2 vote-wins lost at every τ (in fact flat to τ=2.0; the round showed "safety" is pool structure, not a τ boundary: all 4 incremental band fires are wrong promotions on vote-dead entries, band precision 14%). ARC-2: τ=0.005 fires once (the 1/493-cell near-miss), doubling pass@1 0.0323→0.0645. **Production setting: τ=0.005 only + vote-aware guard** (the 25094a63 exact-match mis-fire is τ-untouchable).
+- **Part B (k=3 independent-induction agreement gate, 46 fresh codex calls @600s, transcripts archived):** any-of-3 demo-perfect 18/31; **agreement on only 1/31 — gold, but n=1 (CP95 [0.025,1.0]) and on a flagged ARC-1-reuse task**; per-sample precision 0.5217 (= the probe's 0.47–0.50). Coverage collapse is arithmetic (14/31 singleton entries; binomial predicts 1.42 events); single-shot induction ≈0.20/call vs the chain's ~0.55/lineage (confounded with codex run-variance, Fisher p=0.092); disagreements are 2/3 junk-killing, 1/3 recall cost; correlated arms restore coverage at exactly the unconditional 0.5 — **independence IS the precision signal**; near-miss output clustering REFUTED (wrong programs cluster); no cheap gold-vs-wrong observable (AUCs 0.43–0.62).
+- **Adversarial round (`results/arc3_gap4_precision_fixes_adversarial_verify.json`): 5/5 CONFIRMED, every number bit-exact — and the round CAUGHT A LIVE DATA-LOSS BUG:** a reviewer's `--part a` re-run clobbered the artifact via the script's unconditional write (the docstring even advertised the footgun command); reviewers reconstructed Part B deterministically from the 69 archived transcripts (bit-identical) and restored it with a recovery note. Clobber guard shipped same-day (part-A-only runs write to a sidecar when Part B exists). Standing lesson reinforced: COMMIT ARTIFACTS AT LANDING TIME — untracked artifacts have zero clobber protection.
+- **Banked successor design (zero new codex):** tiered harness = chain+agreement hybrid (saved chained program + 2 archived fresh singles: measured 2/31 at 2/2 gold — doubles Part-B coverage free) → graded gate τ=0.005 → vote; on weak-vote venues the EV-optimal composite is promote-any-demo-perfect (~9.5× vote pass@1 at 0.52 precision). **Next codex purchase when bought: k=3 CHAIN arms on the ~13 chain-feasible tasks** (projects ~5/31 agreement-gold), pre-registered on clean tasks with ≥5/5 clean agreement-gold required — NOT k=5–7 singles. Ledger + corrigenda in `ops/verifier_gaps.md` and the ensemble artifact.
